      <h2 class="founder-h">Hey, I'm <em>Mees</em> — and I built Lio because nobody else was solving the part that actually matters.</h2>

      <p>Like most people, I grew up around smokers.</p>
      <p>I watched the New Year's promises. The patches in the kitchen drawer. The cough that came back every winter.</p>
      <p>And I watched how hard the people I love tried to stop — and how often the products on the shelf let them down.</p>
