      <p>The reason it doesn't work isn't a character flaw. It's that every patch, every gum, every vape is solving the wrong problem.</p>
      <p>Here's what nobody in the quit industry will tell you: <strong>80% of smoking isn't nicotine.</strong> It's the hand, the breath, the pause built into your day.</p>
